---
import DocsLayout from "@layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Contributing" description="How to contribute to Axon">
    <h1>Contributing</h1>

    <p>
        Axon is a personal project, but contributions are welcome. Before
        submitting changes, please open an issue to discuss the proposed
        changes.
    </p>

    <h2>Reporting Issues</h2>
    <p>
        Use the <a href="https://github.com/GordenArcher/axon/issues"
            >GitHub Issues</a
        >
        tracker to report bugs or request features. Please include:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Axon version</li>
        <li>Operating system and version</li>
        <li>Steps to reproduce the issue</li>
        <li>Expected vs. actual behavior</li>
        <li>Screenshots or logs if applicable</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Setting Up Development Environment</h2>
    <p>
        Follow the <a href="/docs/development/building">Building from Source</a> guide
        to set up your development environment.
    </p>

    <h2>Coding Standards</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>TypeScript</strong> — Use strict type checking</li>
        <li><strong>React</strong> — Functional components with hooks</li>
        <li><strong>Go</strong> — Follow standard Go conventions</li>
        <li>
            <strong>Formatting</strong> — Prettier for TypeScript, gofmt for Go
        </li>
        <li>
            <strong>Linting</strong> — ESLint for TypeScript, golangci-lint for Go
        </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Commit Messages</h2>
    <p>Follow conventional commits:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><code>feat:</code> — New feature</li>
        <li><code>fix:</code> — Bug fix</li>
        <li><code>docs:</code> — Documentation changes</li>
        <li><code>style:</code> — Code style changes</li>
        <li><code>refactor:</code> — Code refactoring</li>
        <li><code>test:</code> — Adding or updating tests</li>
        <li><code>chore:</code> — Maintenance tasks</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Pull Request Process</h2>
    <ol>
        <li>Fork the repository</li>
        <li>Create a feature branch</li>
        <li>Make your changes</li>
        <li>
            Run tests (<code>npm test</code> and <code>go test ./...</code>)
        </li>
        <li>Update documentation if needed</li>
        <li>Submit a pull request to the <code>main</code> branch</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Code of Conduct</h2>
    <p>
        Be respectful and constructive. Axon follows the
        <a href="https://www.contributor-covenant.org/">Contributor Covenant</a>
        Code of Conduct.
    </p>
</DocsLayout>
